{
  "intro": [
    "Gamepasses are bundles of Perks that can be purchased for Robux and either benefits the player in the process of progressing through the game or enhance gameplay outside of making money, keep in mind that these passes are not necessary to obtain most items in-game and there are many other resources in Miner's Haven to help you.",
    "Miner's Haven has a variety of current gamepasses on sale along with many gamepasses or packs that can no longer be purchased.",
    "Alongside massive gamepass sales, annual Black Friday events feature smaller gamepasses with their own perks and gimmicks."
  ],
  "trivia": [
    "Gamepasses tend to go on sale during special and seasonal events. Keep your eyes peeled!",
    "Before the Reincarnation Update, you were unable to change your chat prefix with the V.I.P., Premium, Executive, and Dark Knight gamepasses. For example, if you had V.I.P. and Premium, your chat prefix would be [Premium] instead of [VIP].",
    "If you have the golden Premium particles, they will be replaced with red Executive particles, as there is no way to switch them as of right now.",
    "The V.I.P Mining Gamepass, during the Black Friday 2016, was put on sale for 1 for at least 1 minute, with the 55 and 120 products on sale for a few seconds for 1.",
    "The Base Radio gamepass was made to compensate for the now removed radio GUI. It was retired after Roblox purged the audio library, effectively making the gamepass a waste of Robux. Some form of compensation is planned for the future."
  ],
